---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import ProjectGrid from '../components/ProjectGrid.vue';
---

<Layout title="Sakha Wibisono | Frontend Developer" description="Frontend developer and Informatics graduate from Telkom University. I build responsive interfaces and connect them to the data behind them.">
  <main id="content" class="shell page space-y-16">
    <section class="grid gap-5 lg:grid-cols-[1.7fr_1fr]">
      <div class="glass-card flex flex-col justify-between p-7 sm:p-12">
        <p class="eyebrow"><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 bg-accent" aria-hidden="true"></span>Frontend developer - Fresh graduate, Informatics Telkom University</p>
        <div class="my-10 sm:my-14">
          <h1 class="text-[clamp(2.5rem,5.8vw,4.7rem)] font-medium leading-[1.08] tracking-[-0.055em]">Hi, I'm Sakha.<br />I build things<br /><span class="text-accent">for the web.</span></h1>
          <p class="mt-6 max-w-md text-sm text-muted sm:text-base">Mostly interfaces. Sometimes the backend behind them. I've shipped SSO screens for a state-owned enterprise, built sales dashboards for a fintech platform, and helped develop academic tools used inside Telkom University. Somewhere in between all of that, I wrote a thesis on using generative AI to map maintenance workflows in power plant data.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
          <a href="/projects" class="button button-primary">See my work <svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/icons/tabler.svg#arrow-right" /></svg></a>
          <a href="/contact" class="button"><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/icons/tabler.svg#mail" /></svg>Let's talk</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <aside class="flex flex-col gap-5" aria-label="A little about me">
        <div class="glass-card flex flex-1 flex-col justify-between gap-8 p-7 sm:p-8">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span class="eyebrow">A little context</span><svg class="icon text-accent" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/icons/tabler.svg#school" /></svg></div>
          <div><h2 class="text-2xl font-medium tracking-tight">Learning by<br />building.</h2><p class="mt-3 text-sm text-muted">Started with a diploma in Software Application Engineering, then moved into the Informatics bachelor's program at the same university. Not because two degrees look good on paper, but because every finished project left me with more questions than when I started.</p></div>
          <a href="/about" class="text-link">More about me <svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/icons/tabler.svg#arrow-up-right" /></svg></a>
        </div>
        <div class="glass-card p-7 sm:p-8">
          <p class="eyebrow"><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/icons/tabler.svg#briefcase" /></svg>Most recently</p>
          <h2 class="mt-5 text-lg font-medium">Programmer intern at Peruri.</h2>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted">Three months finding out what secure authentication actually means when real users depend on it. Astro, Vue, OAuth 2.0, OpenID Connect, and a long list of edge cases that nobody bothered writing documentation for.</p>
          <a href="/experience" class="text-link mt-5">My experience <svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/icons/tabler.svg#arrow-right" /></svg></a>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="work-title">
      <div class="mb-6 flex flex-wrap items-end justify-between gap-4">
        <div><p class="eyebrow mb-3">A few things I've worked on</p><h2 id="work-title" class="section-title">Selected work</h2></div>
        <a href="/projects" class="text-link">All projects <svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/icons/tabler.svg#arrow-up-right" /></svg></a>
      </div>
      <ProjectGrid client:load featured />
    </section>

    <section class="glass-card flex flex-col justify-between gap-6 p-7 sm:p-10 md:flex-row md:items-center">
      <div><p class="eyebrow mb-3">Have something in mind?</p><h2 class="section-title">I'd like to hear about it.</h2><p class="mt-3 max-w-lg text-sm text-muted">A role, a project, or just a question about something in my work. Send me a note and we can take it from there.</p></div>
      <a href="/contact" class="button button-primary shrink-0 self-start md:self-auto">Get in touch <svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/icons/tabler.svg#arrow-up-right" /></svg></a>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
